    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35905" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">phălăris</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">phălēris</span></b> ), ĭdis,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαλαρίς</span> or
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαληρίς</span>. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>The plant canarygrass</i> (Phalaris canariensis,
			Linn.), <i><span class="en">Plin. 27, 12, 102, §
			126</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A water-hen</i>, <i>coot</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 3, 11 <i>fin.</i></span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 8,
			15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Plin. 10, 48, 67, §
		132</span></i>.</div>
